---
description: Astra team memory map - read before every task
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root before every task and follow its memory map rules:
read `memory/MAP.md` and `memory/HANDOFF.md` first, update `memory/status/<you>.md` at the
start and end of each task, append-only to `memory/DECISIONS.md` and `memory/TRAPS.md`,
never write secrets.
